[D f. 99v]#/ /rgya gar skad du/ aa rtsinta kra ma au pa de sha n'a ma/ bod skad du/ 
bsam gyis mi khyab pa'i rim pa'i man ngan ces bya ba/ dpal rdo rje sems dpa' la phyag 'tshal lo/ /bcom ldan 'das 'jig rten dbang phyug la phyag 'tshal lo/ /

[ed. p. 195]
namo vajrasattvāya

prajñāgragarbhasaṃbhūtam acintyam advayaṃ vibhum |
praṇamya likhyate samyag bhadrapādakramāgatam || 1 ||

prajñopāyamahāguhyaṃ karuṇācintyalakṣaṇam |
svayam utpadyate jñānaṃ vākpathātītagocaram || 2 ||

na cāsau bhāvarūpeṇa svayambhūr advayottamam |
na cābhāvena dṛśyante bodhisattvāḥ savajriṇaḥ || 3 ||

śāśvatocchedabhedena (bhedo na) paramārtho 'dvayam ucyate |
bhāvanā tu (na) svabhāvo 'yaṃ nopalambho na śūnyatā || 4 || 

dvayor vicāryamāṇena jvalate jñānam advayam |
advayākāra sarvaṃ tu dvayam etan na vidyate || 5 ||

samaṃ samarasākāram acintyajñānam uttamam |
kalpanājñānayogena na bhāvyam advayottamam || 6 ||

nirvikalpam acintyaṃ na prāpyate sukhavajriṇaḥ (ṇā) |
utpattiḥ kalpanāhetur anutpattis tathaiva ca || 7 ||

[ed. p. 196]
ubhayākārarahitaṃ vāsyavāsakavajitam |
vāsanārahitaṃ jñānaṃ bhadrapādakramāgatam || 8 ||

svayambhūr nistaraṅgaṃ tu sarvasaṅkalpavarjitam |
bhāvābhāvasvabhāvaṃ tu vāsanādvayabandhanam || 9 ||

nirvikalpasvabhāvena acintyaṃ na ca cchidyate |
kalpanāmalajālena cittaratnaṃ malīkṛtam || 10 ||

malāpagamanād buddham advayaṃ jñānam ucyate |
nirvikalpātmakaṃ sarvaṃ draṣṭavyaṃ yogibhiḥ sadā || 11 ||

samādhibhāvanā hy eṣā bhadrapādena deśitā |
yasya svabhāvo notpattir vināśo naiva vidyate || 12 ||

taj jñānam advayaṃ nāma sarvasaṅkalpavarjitam |
kalpanā sva(su)samākhyātā buddhair vajradharādibhiḥ || 13 ||

nirvikalpārthajanakaṃ śrīmahāsukhavajriṇa[ḥ] |
bāhyādhyātmavikalpena sarvalokāḥ samāśritāḥ || 14 ||

advayā(ya)dvayanirmuktaṃ jñānamutpadyate svayam |
abhāve bhāvanā naiva bhāve ca na ca bhāvanā || 15 ||

alabhyaṃ sukhacaitanyam acintyamadvayaṃ padam |
sarvasattveṣu yaścintyaḥ prajñāgarbhe vyavasthitaḥ || 16 ||

karuṇāprabodhabāṇena lakṣyaṃ vedhyaṃ mahāsukham |
sarvaśaṅkāvinirmuktaṃ nirdvandvaṃ paramaṃ śivam || 17 ||

[ed. p. 197]
khasamaṃ kalpanāmuktam advayaṃ tu tad ucyate |
acintyapadayogena sarvabhāvān vibhāvayet || 18 ||

kathitaṃ bhadrapādena dharmapādakramāgatam |
ekalolīsvabhāvena jagadākāranirmitam || 19 ||

śrīmahāsukhanāthena advayākārabhedataḥ |
śūnyopalambhavādena mithyāvādena vāhitāḥ || 20 ||

kalpanājaḍabandhena naiva buddhayanti śrīsukham |
duṣkalpakalpanā vānyā prajñopāyaviśuddhitaḥ || 21||

mahāyogādvayajñānam ekam eva mahāsukham |
sarva(rve) sthiracarā bhāvā advayena vyavasthitāḥ || 22 ||

svabhāvenādiśuddhānte śāntākāśe sunirmalāḥ |
advayānnā(yaṃ nā)mamātraṃ tu tac ca nāma na vidyate || 23 ||

veda(dya)vedakanirlakṣyam advayaṃ tu mahāsukham |
na buddha buddhiviṣayā (yo) acintyo 'yaṃ svabhāvataḥ || 24 ||

tatsvabhāvaṃ tu sarvaṃ vai cintātītaṃ svayambhuvaḥ |
sarve vikalpajālena naśyante prāṇino bhuvi || 25 ||

advayajñānam ekaṃ tu sarvasaṅkalpavarjitam |
yāvan no śāśvatocchedo rāśidvayaṃ na vidyate || 26 ||

madhyamā nopalabdhis tu advayaṃ jñānam adbhutam |
sarvaprapañcarahitam ākāśam iva nirmalam || 27 ||

kalpanājālavicchinnama cintyādvayam uttamam |
advayarasaviddhena kāṣṭhapāṣāṇamṛṇmayāḥ || 28 ||

devatākāratāṃ yānti bhadrapādena deśitam |
prajñopāyamahākaruṇāsamarasākāram ekataḥ || 29 ||

tasmin niṣpadyate jñānam advayaṃ tu mahāsukham |
rūpaśabdarasātītaṃ gandhasparśādivarjitam || 30 ||

dharmadhātumayaṃ śuddha[m advayaṃ] jñānam uttamam |
sarvasaṅkalpanirmuktaṃ grāhyagrāhakavarjitam || 31 ||

svabhāvaśuddhaṃ nilayam advayaṃ pāramārthikam |
avināśam anutpattim anakṣaram anālayam || 32 ||

mahāmudreyam atyantam advayaṃ jñānam uttamam |
doṣāṇāṃ ca guṇānāṃ ca cittam ārādha(dhāra)m ucyate || 33 ||

tasmin vyāptiparaṃ jñānaṃ nistaraṅgaṃ svabhāvataḥ |
svayam utpadyate jñānaṃ na kiñcid api bhāvayet || 34 ||

yasmād acintyadharmo 'yaṃ buddhānām advayaṃ padam |
sunirmalaṃ mahāśuddhaṃ bhāvyabhāvakavarjitam || 35 ||

avikalpena sarvaṃ vai dṛśyate śrīsukhodayam |
anekadevatārūpaṃ vajrasattvādivigraham || 36 ||

buddhabimbaṃ ca sakalaṃ yoginīgaṇamaṇḍalam |
krodharājasamastaṃ vā vidyādevī tathaiva ca || 37 ||

[ed. p. 199]
divyamaṇḍalacakraṃ tu ālokākāranirmalam |
sūtrānta(ntaṃ) vinayopetaṃ tathā pāramitānayam || 38 ||

mantramudrās tathā vidyā hṛdaye codanaṃ tathā |
mantravādam aśeṣaṃ vai maṇḍalaṃ homakarma ca || 39 ||

japapūjāvidhānaṃ ca svayam utpadyate kramāt |
darśanaṃ śaivaṃ sauraṃ ca arhantaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ tathā || 40 ||

sarvajñapada yogo 'yam acintyaṃ nirvikalpakam || 41 ||

divyaṃ samantabhadrākhyaṃ cintāmaṇir ivādvayam | 
pātālakhaḍgaguṭikāyakṣiṇīpādusaṃghaṭam || 42 ||

rasāñjanaṃ ca divyaṃ ca svayaṃ siddhayanti nānyathā |
avikalpādhimokṣeṇa sarvamutpadyate svayam || 43 ||

bhāvaṃ na bhāvayen mantrī sva(a)bhāvaṃ naiva bhāvayet |
kiṃ tasya bhaṇyate buddho na śivo viṣṇur arhataḥ || 44 ||

na tasya vidyate nāma na rūpaṃ varṇalakṣaṇam |
māyākāradharaṃ divyaṃ skandhaṃ prakṛtinirmalam || 45 ||

prakṛtiprabhāsvarākāraṃ nityānandasukhodayam |
kāyavākcittarahitaṃ darpaṇaṃ jālapuñjakam || 46 ||

paramānandasukhākāraṃ nityoditamahāsukham |
deśanāpadayogena nāmavarṇa prabhāṣaṇam || 47 ||

[ed. p. 200] anyathā vākpathātītaṃ kathituṃ naiva pāryate |
kriyānta(to) nayarūpeṇa iṣṭārthaṃ tava līlayā || 48 ||

pūjārahasyakālaṃ tu bhadrapādena deśitam |
jñānenādvayabhūtena ekākārasvabhāvataḥ || 49 ||

vāsanā kṣayatāṃ yāti buddhatvaṃ prāpyate dhruvam |
nānāvarṇaprabhedena nānādarśanayogataḥ || 50 ||

vāsanāmalasiktena advayaṃ naiva buddhayate |
ādimadhyāntarahitaṃ niṣpannotpattivarjitam || 51 ||

tyaktaṃ cittaṃ [ca] caitanyaṃ tadadvayajñānam uttamam |
advayo nāma buddhasya bhadrapādena deśitaḥ || 52 ||

tadbuddhavedanād buddho sa bhavet sādhakottamaḥ |
deśanāpadayogena buddhaḥ advayakalpitaḥ || 53 ||

paramārthabhedarūpeṇa na buddho nāpi cādvayam |
udite jñānasadbhāve kalpanāmaladūrataḥ || 54 ||

tattvāt parokṣatāṃ yāti sarvabhāvāvikalpatām |
bhadrapādaprasādena śravaṇābhyāsayogataḥ || 55 ||

advayaṃ nāma gṛhṇāmi kṣantavyaṃ mama yogibhiḥ |
vāsanākṣaya[ḥ] kartavyā(vyo) yatnenāpi vipaścitaiḥ(tā) || 56 ||

anyathā na ca buddhatvaṃ kalpāsaṃkhyeyakoṭibhiḥ |
jñānenādvayanāthena vāsanā kriyate kṣayaḥ || 57 ||

[ed. p. 201] vāsanākṣayajātena hy advayo buddha ucyate |
vāsanārahitāvasthe puruṣe 'dhamamadhyamāḥ || 58 ||

buddhas tu (ddhatvaṃ) bhaṇyate tasya na pakṣo 'py atra vidyate |
niḥsvabhāva svarūpeṇa prajñābhāgas tu saṃsthitaḥ || 59 ||

tayor ālamba(mela)nādekaṃ samarasākārayogataḥ |
bhadrapādena deśitam idam advayam uttamam || 60 ||

na kathābhāvanā cintyā paramānandarūpiṇī |
bhadreṇa bhadraṃ kathitaṃ buddhatvaprāptikāraṇam || 61||

upamā sarvadharmeṣu dātuṃ naiva ca pāryate |
cakṣurādimano jñānaṃ dṛṣṭāntabhāvavarjitam || 62 ||

eka eva anādyo 'sau anantākārasaṃsthitaḥ |
jñāyate param ekena gurupādaprasādataḥ || 63 ||

yoga[ḥ] puruṣa ākhyātaḥ anuyogastu saṃvṛtiḥ |
mahāyogādvayajñāne buddhatvaṃ yānti yoginaḥ || 64 ||

candrasūryoparāgeṣu prajñāvajraprayogataḥ |
vilīne advayajñāne buddhatvam iha janmani || 65 ||

parārthānandayogo'sau grāhyagrāhakavarjitaḥ |
siddharūpamasandigdhaṃ karuṇādvayamuttamam || 66 ||

[ed. p. 202]
cakṣurbhyāṃ dṛśyate yacca rūpaṃ dharmaṃ ca madhyamam |
paramānandarūpeṇa draṣṭavyamadvayottamam || 67 ||

śrotraiśca śrūyate yacca yacca śabdavibhāgataḥ |
śabdātītaṃ paraṃ jñānaṃ śravaṇamadvayottamam || 68 ||

jihvā cāsvā(sva)date yacca virasā rasamuttamaḥ (mam) |
ṣaḍrasamekabhāvena boddhavyamadvayottamam || 69 ||

ghrāṇaśca gandhavijñāne mṛgamadādyasu (śu) cismṛtiḥ |
ekalolīsvabhāvena jñāyate cādvayo ttamam || 70 ||

kāya sparśasvabhāvena jātyajātivibhāgataḥ |
prajñopāya viyogena niṣpanna madvayottamam || 71 ||

anantaṃ vyāpakaṃ sarvaṃ jñānālokaprabhāvataḥ |
svacchandaparamānandamadvayā (yaṃ) buddhasatsukham || 72 ||

saṃskāra (ro) vedanā saṃjñā rūpaṃ vijñānameva ca |
pañcajñānamayaṃ (yaḥ) kāyaḥ pañcabuddho 'dvayottamaḥ || 73 ||

śāśvatākṣobhya ratnāyuramoghastu tathaiva ca |
pañcamekamayaṃ piṇḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhamastu mahāsukhaḥ || 74 ||

pṛthivyāpastathā tejo vāyurākāśameva ca |
pañcabhūta mahotpattirbhaved vai bodhiradvayaḥ || 75 ||

ādarśasamatākṛtyānuṣṭhāna pratyavekṣādharmadhātubhiḥ |
vikalpāḥ kalpanārūpāḥ svayambhūrekamadvayaḥ || 76 ||

[ed. p. 203]
darśanādervibhāvena sattvāśayavase (śe) na tu |
śaivādivaiṣṇavā brahmā sarvajña eko'dvayaḥ || 77 ||

cakṣurādi (de ) [ra] vaikalyaṃ manasātītagocaram |
paramārtho'dvayo nāma vākprapañcastu saṃvṛtiḥ || 78 ||

paramārthāvasthabhede[na] na buddho nāpi cādvayaḥ |
kalpanākāśayogena vāk prapañcastu kathyate || 79 ||

sarvaśāstrānukramato vyākhyānoktivibhāgataḥ |
anyathā kathituṃ naiva śakyate buddhamadvayam || 80 ||

śṛtā[ḥ] ṣoḍaśa ākhyātā [ ḥ ] prajñāstu (di) daśa kalpitāḥ |
buddhāśca pañca saṃkhyātā advayaśca ṣaḍāvṛtiḥ || 81 ||

darpaṇa' lokabimbeṣu yathā sarvaṃ pradṛśyate |
tathaivādvayajñāne'smin buddhabodhi racintitā || 82 ||

dhātukeṣu sarveṣu utpattisthitihetubhiḥ |
tatsarvamadvayajñānaṃ udbhūtāḥ sarvajantavaḥ || 83 ||

sāgarāḥ parvatā vṛkṣāstṛṇagulmalatāśca ye |
viniḥsṛtā advayajñāna [[d] bhrāntiratra na vidyate || 84 ||

mātā pitā ca ekatra dvayametanna vidyate |
advayajñānasadbhāve sarvamutpadyate param || 85 ||

etenopāyayogena prajñādvayasvabhāvataḥ |
buddhatvaṃ labhyate sadyo janmanī haiva yoginaḥ ( nā ) || 86 ||

[ed. p. 204]
bhāvanācintyayogena buddhyate (ddhatvaṃ ) prāpyate dhruvam |
paramāśva[]] vīṇāpāda indrabhūtiḥ salakṣmibhiḥ || 88 ||

vilāsavajra ( jo ) guṇḍerī padmācāryaṃ (ryo) mahākṛpaḥ |
dharmapādasya kramato bhadrapādakramāgatāḥ || 89 ||

eko'bhiprāyaḥ sarveṣāmadvayam̐ jñānamuttamam |
mantravādamaśeṣaṃ ca tathā pāramitānayaḥ || 90 ||

sūtrāntapiṭakādibhyo'traikādvaya mahāsukham |
arhantasauraśaivādyāḥ somasiddhānta eva ca || 91 ||

vaiṣṇavo mānavo dharmo advayena tu deśitāḥ |
nāsti cādvayavākle tena devāsuranarādhamāḥ || 92 ||

sarvaṃ tu cādvayajñānaṃ dṛśyate pratibhāṣa ( sa ) taḥ |
advayaṃ (yaḥ) karuṇāmiśraḥ prajñopāyasamanvitaḥ || 93 ||

śūnyatābhedabhinnastu sarvabuddhamayo guruḥ |
bhadrapādamataṃ hyetajjñānasāgaramuttamam || 94 ||

kṣīrodamathanākāraṃ sarvamutpadyate param |
brahmā (hma) viṣṇumaheśvarabuddhādyā ye ca kīrtitāḥ || 95 ||

somasūryaṃsatārāśca jñānasāgarasambhavāḥ |
lakṣmīḥ sarasvatī caiva amṛtaṃ rasamuttamam || 96 ||

[ed. p. 205] amṛtādutthitaṃ sarvaṃ sadevāsuramānuṣam |
trayodaśī ca vikhyātā bhūmirvajradharī śubhā || 97 ||

trikoṇākārasambhūtā dharmodaya iti smṛtā |
candrārkavāri sampūrṇā prajñārūpā mahojjvalā || 98 ||

sukhāt sarvamahāsaukhyā buddhatvāvāptikāriṇī |
koṭipatraṃ mahāpadmaṃ tatra madhye vyavasthitam || 99 ||

sadā sakesarādyanta (ntai) rvā''likālisamanvitaiḥ |
candrasūryapaṭā cchi (ccha) nnaṃ navaprajñāsamanvitam || 100 ||

śra (sra) vantaṃ jvalanā kāraṃ binducandrodayaṃ param |
ānandajanakaṃ divyamaśeṣārthaṃphalapradam || 101 ||

svacchāmṛtasamaṃ pūrṇaṃ maṇiratnasamanvitam |
aparyaṃntaguṇādhāraṃ sthānaṃ śrī suka ( kha ) vajriṇam (ṇaḥ ) || 102 ||

sarvamāhlādakaraṇī sṛṣṭisaṃhārakāriṇī |
anekadevatārūpaṃ sāgarādvayasaṃbhavam || 103 ||

dharmasaṃbhogarūpaṃ tu nirmāṇa kāyameva ca |
anekasarvaṃsattvārthadharmacakrapravartakam || 104 ||

daśadiśā nantaparyantaṃ lokadhātuḥ samantataḥ |
daśajñānabalopetaṃ prajñā pradhānamuttamam || 105 ||

[ed. p. 206]
kha[dhātugaṃ dhruvaṃ padmamārgaṃ] bhadrakramāgatam |
garbhapadmaṃ nābhipadmaṃ (ca) kaṇṭha padmaṃ tathaiva ca || 106 ||

ṣaṣṭikā yāni padmaṃ ca tiryagdvāre vyavasthitam |
paśyanti pratiśravaṇaṃ vedanaiśca susaṃsthitāḥ || 107 ||

viṇmūtraśukasaṃcāranavadvāreṣu' saṃgatiḥ
viṣa ( sa ) tantusamākārā adha ūrdhvaṃ vyavasthitā || 108 ||

prajñānāmeti vikhyātā sarvabuddhestu mātaraḥ |
tatra madhye sthito devaḥ parameśvaramadvayam || 109 ||

krīḍate triṣu padmeṣu sarvajñastu mahāsukham
agnivāruṇamāhendravāyunā samalaṅkṛtā (tam ) || 110 ||

bhrāmyamānaṃ (ṇaṃ) śanairyuktā ( ktyā) triṣu padmaṣu nīyate |
ghaṇṭikācchidra mārgeṇa nāsāpuṭaprayogataḥ || 111 ||

nālikāvajravivare buddha ( ddhaya ) mānastu cādvayaḥ |
cakreṇa  vikale (lāṃ) śastu viśrāmya ghaṇṭikāgrataḥ || 112 ||

amṛtapānaṃ kurvīta vajrajihvāprayogataḥ |
tatastu jāyate kāyaḥ śuddha [ḥ] prakṛtinirmalaḥ || 113 ||

divyaprajñā ma [[ ] navī ca jarāmṛtyuvināśakṛt |
yogo'yaṃ bhadrapādena kathito mama līlayā || 114 ||

[ed. p. 207]
samādhiramṛtaṃ nāma satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
nāsā niḥśvāsabhedena hakārastu anāhataḥ || 115 ||

ghaṇṭikābhe (cche ) damārgeṣu ' dvātriṃśannāḍayo matāḥ |
dvātriśaddeśa enāḥ proktā akalakala ( lā ) advayāḥ || 116 ||

nāsāniḥ śvāsabhedena kakārastu anāhataḥ |
ghaṇṭikā randhramārgeṇa nītvā mārgapathaṃ dhruvam || 117 ||

tatra dvāre tu viśrāmya śuddhākāraṃ prabhāsvaram |
anādiradvayo nāma śrīsukhākārasaṃsthitaḥ || 118 ||

tatastu 'prerayed vāyuṃ māhendra mupanīyate |
sphuṭate dhruvamārgaṃ tu parameśvara' manāhataḥ || 119 ||

bhūmiṃ trayodaśīṃ prāptaḥ sukhaśca ( kāya ) ivāparaḥ |
anādisiddhirūpastu dharmacakrapravartakaḥ || 120 ||

bhadrapādasya āmnāya [ḥ] nibandho (ddho 'lpakastathā |
yacchrutamavadhāritaṃ tadbhāvanāśrutacintayā || 121 ||

bhadrapādaprasādena śravaṇābhyāsayogataḥ |
kuddālanāma (mā) kuśalī tena saṃgrathito hyayam || 122 ||

bhadrapādasya dāso'ha manyeṣāmācārya yoginām |
sattvānāma [pya]śeṣāṇāṃ bhaveyaṃ janmajanmani || 123 ||

[ed. p. 208]
anenāśaya dvāreṇa yadi buddho bhavāmyaham |
athavā narakaṃ yāmi naraka eva sukhāvatī || 124 ||

